		<blockquote class="quoteContainer"><div class="quote">Ten years after Avicii’s final live performance, never-before-seen footage from the Closing Party at Ushuaïa Ibiza is being shared for the first time.<br>
<br>
Captured on August 28, 2016, the footage comes from a GoPro mounted on stage, offering a unique perspective that stays with Avicii throughout the set.<br>
<br>
